# API & Server Rules - Overview

## Related Documentation

- **[server-actions.mdc](./server-actions.mdc)** - Server action patterns, data fetching, validation, error handling
- **[api-routes.mdc](./api-routes.mdc)** - API route patterns, authentication, caching, external APIs
- **[user-api.mdc](./user-api.mdc)** - User library endpoints (watchlist, watched, ratings, recents)

## Quick Reference

### When to Use Server Actions vs API Routes

| Use Case | Approach |
|----------|----------|
| Data fetching for pages | Server Actions |
| Form mutations | Server Actions |
| Webhooks | API Routes |
| External callbacks | API Routes |
| User library CRUD | API Routes |
| Admin endpoints | API Routes |
| Third-party integrations | API Routes |

### File Locations

```
src/server/
├── actions/           # Server Actions (preferred for data fetching)
│   ├── movie.ts
│   ├── series.ts
│   ├── person.ts
│   ├── trending.ts
│   ├── discover.ts
│   └── hover-card.ts
├── services/          # External API wrappers
│   ├── tmdb.ts
│   └── youtube.ts
└── db/
    ├── index.ts       # Connection setup
    ├── cached-queries.ts
